This directory contains minimal regression examples for the
``fix pimd/uvt`` style in the REPLICA package.

Files:

- ``in.electron_pimd_uvt`` runs a quadratic toy model with an analytic
  constant-potential equilibrium using a two-bead PIMD integrator.
- ``in.electron_pimd_uvt_restart`` continues from the restart written by
  ``in.electron_pimd_uvt`` and can be used to check restart continuity.

Build LAMMPS with the REPLICA package enabled before running these
examples.

Run ``in.electron_pimd_uvt`` with a partitioned launch, for example
``mpirun -np 2 lmp -partition 2x1 -in in.electron_pimd_uvt``, before
running ``in.electron_pimd_uvt_restart`` with the same partition layout.
